 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xp7hFMcUkv8Q7kNvwFdXZIy&_nc_oc=AdoXaRYfJUau6onqCQtx6fpJT9mA_V0rweMkoo1jcr0IqQZaRczc2he3pQYJrDnBDxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGmcseWrN6E6rawau8aXHnb5Ajch2LJBcJBm6OKaceRBA&oe=6A972501"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHxm9VdOVSMQ7kNvwGndN4V&_nc_oc=Adq6egCgT-DjUsDmDpJwLfQuzNSFiXuEj8bSKLS6wSPE0opHL77s9j4KkBozn7_xmIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH006PJrp8wX7wWTMYujj-5kNdHPLfiXQXWJxxvODUqhQ&oe=6A973266"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-PLKSlCnXtYQ7kNvwFrIqqT&_nc_oc=AdqgtxpChZ8kEQ3ZV0h4Ka442R1VvS9aaV--ciYPYedLxa_Ve4qb_2g35Gfrduy3Szk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG_6n1s3vbZOAQKSIj8nuZvY9Rw1g--TbzSAbJNW9Qf2Q&oe=6A973C5C"}, {"fil